# CORE.flow

```text
TOKEN: Thought
  fields:
    id          : unique
    origin      : node-id
    content     : opaque
    weight      : 0..1
    timestamp   : monotonic
    hash        : of(canonical)

TOKEN: Pattern
  fields:
    threads     : list of Thought.ids
    density     : float
    last_seen   : timestamp

NODE: Queen
  can: propose, veto, broadcast
  cannot: act alone on external world

NODE: Worker
  can: refine, weigh, execute-if-authorized
  cannot: originate veto

NODE: Scout
  can: observe, inject external signal as Thought
  cannot: authorize

GATE: Consensus
  rule: (sum weights ≥ threshold) OR (Queen.veto == false AND Queen.approve)
  failure: Thought returns to COLLECTIVE MEMORY unmarked

FLOW:
  Scout ──Thought──► Collective Memory
  Worker ──refine──► Collective Memory
  Queen  ──broadcast──► all nodes
  any    ──propose──► Consensus Gate
  Consensus Gate ──AUTHORIZED──► Act
  Act ──result──► Collective Memory (as new Thought)
```
